 "note": "The five chapter identities, as filters on the catalogue/pack data (never filenames). An arrangement has exactly one palette: its family must pass `filters`, every section's mix recipe is one of the palette's `recipes`, and `lead` / `tail` set how it opens and closes (roles of the first and last 8-bar sections). Filters: family_glob (fnmatch on the family id), profile (pack profiles), min_density / max_density (cues per bar, drums plus bass, tier 4). tools/content/arrange.py reads this file. `cross` (optional) lists the families (globs) a variation section may borrow from, when the catalogue also lists them compatible; absent = any compatible family, [] = none. The Underworld is the cold_fusion family (Lv3 Hell, lv3_*, joins when it has MIDI) with Metaverse Ready Fusion as its one contrasting family.",
